      "privacyPolicy": {
        "enabled": true,
        "title": "Saw Dash Privacy Policy",
        "content": "Privacy Policy for Saw Dash\n\nLast updated: September 2026\n\n1. Overview\nSaw Dash ('we', 'our', or 'us') is dedicated to protecting player privacy. This policy outlines how data is handled when you play Saw Dash.\n\n2. Data Collection\nSaw Dash does not require user account registration. Game progress, high scores, unlocked weapons, and settings are saved locally on your device.\n\n3. Analytics and Advertising\nIf enabled, anonymous gameplay telemetry and crash reporting may be utilized to diagnose stability issues and improve gameplay balance.\n\n4. Contact\nIf you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact our support team at support@1dbraingames.com.",
        "lastUpdated": "2026-09-07",
        "slug": "saw-dash-privacy"
      },
      "termsAndConditions": {
        "enabled": true,
        "title": "Saw Dash Terms & Conditions",
        "content": "Terms and Conditions for Saw Dash\n\n1. Acceptance of Terms\nBy downloading, installing, or playing Saw Dash, you agree to comply with these terms.\n\n2. License\nWe grant you a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to play Saw Dash for personal, non-commercial entertainment.\n\n3. In-Game Assets & Coins\nIn-game coins, guns, and upgrades earned through gameplay are virtual items with no real-world monetary value.\n\n4. Changes\nWe reserve the right to modify or update the game and these terms at any time.",
        "lastUpdated": "2026-09-07",
        "slug": "saw-dash-terms"
      },
